OL,3,GNEWSAFailed IT student guilty of
OL,4,Arevenge attack murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA failed Indian IT student has been
OL,7,Ffound guilty of murdering a woman he
OL,8,Fwas "obsessed" with in a "sustained and
OL,9,Fferocious" knife attack.
OL,11,FThe Old Bailey heard 24-year-old Deepak
OL,12,FSandhu met 39-year-old Chinese national
OL,13,FZiaoqung Ke while she was working at a
OL,14,Fbrothel in Southampton in early 2025.
OL,16,FThey formed what prosecutors described
OL,17,Fas a "relationship of sorts", but it
OL,18,Fsoured when Sandhu stole money from
OL,19,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
